 "question": "B. Is this measure already running in Kymenlaakso wellbeing services county (or in the HUS university hospital area that treats its patients)?\nA. Does recent evidence support the size of effect we assume: does this measure reduce deaths among the people it reaches, and by how much?\nMeasure: Smoking cessation started at the first specialist visit. Every current smoker with suspected lung cancer gets cessation medication and counselling at the first visit, as part of preparing for curative treatment.",
